{
  "uid": "talkmos-backend",
  "title": "Talkmos \u2014 Backend",
  "description": "Operational health from container logs. Business metrics live in the admin panel's own dashboard.",
  "tags": [
    "talkmos",
    "backend",
    "logs"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "service",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "stream": "",
          "type": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values(service)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "backend",
          "value": "backend"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "Populated from the labels Loki actually has, so it shows what is really being collected."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "$service \u2014 lines (range)",
      "description": "Total log lines from the selected service. Zero means it is silent \u2014 which is NOT the same as healthy. See the note panel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"$service\"}[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 1,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "$service \u2014 errors (range)",
      "description": "Error-ish lines from the selected service.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"$service\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|panic|exception)\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "App errors (excl. observability)",
      "description": "Errors across every service except the observability stack (alloy|grafana|loki), which logs about itself and otherwise dominates the count.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"docker\", service!~\"alloy|grafana|loki\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|panic|exception)\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Services reporting",
      "description": "Distinct containers shipping logs. Compare against what you expect to be running.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "count(sum by (service) (count_over_time({job=\"docker\"}[$__range])))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Discovered services \u2014 lines and errors",
      "description": "Every service label Loki has seen in the range. If a container you expect is absent here, it is either not running or not logging \u2014 this is the panel to check first.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (count_over_time({job=\"docker\"}[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (count_over_time({job=\"docker\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|panic|exception)\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "service",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "lines",
              "Value #B": "errors"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "errors"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 25
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "errors"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log volume by service",
      "description": "A line dropping to zero is usually the interesting event.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate({job=\"docker\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "logs/sec"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error rate \u2014 app services",
      "description": "Excludes alloy|grafana|loki.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate({job=\"docker\", service!~\"alloy|grafana|loki\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|panic|exception)\" [$__rate_interval]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "logs/sec"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "$service \u2014 log levels",
      "description": "From the [LEVEL] prefix Alloy lifts into a label. Only the backend emits it; other services show no series here.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (level) (rate({service=\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "logs/sec"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "$service \u2014 recent errors",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service=\"$service\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|panic|exception)\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Silence is not health.** `HTTP_LOG_LEVEL=error` means a healthy, idle backend logs\nnothing at all \u2014 so an empty *$service* panel means \"nothing happened\", not \"nothing is\nrunning\". Confirm liveness with the container healthcheck (`docker compose ps`) or\n`GET /health`, not with this dashboard.\n\n**Use the service picker** at the top left. If `backend` shows no data, open\n*Discovered services* below: it lists every label Loki actually has, which tells you\nwhether the container is absent or merely quiet.\n\n**Errors exclude the observability stack** (alloy, grafana, loki) in the app-wide panels.\nThose containers log about themselves and otherwise dominate the count."
      },
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
